The SVGs in this folder are one per row of AGENTS in ../launch.ts, named by that row's id. All
but one are LobeHub's brand icons, copied from @lobehub/icons-static-svg 1.95.0
(https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons); factory-droid.svg is Factory's own mark, taken from the
logo on factory.com and fitted to the same 24-unit box, since LobeHub's set has none. The logos
themselves belong to their products. LobeHub's set is MIT licensed:

